<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S13.F3.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 3</span>: </span><span id="S13.F3.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Ablation study on insertion and unmasking quality for the small molecule experiment.<span id="S13.F3.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> Average reward values of <math id="S13.F3.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="50" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>50</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">50</annotation></semantics></math> sequences sampled from the fine-tuned model after each fine-tuning epoch are plotted over a total of <math id="S13.F3.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="500" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn>500</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">500</annotation></semantics></math> iterations, and a running average is shown with the smooth line. </span></span></figcaption>
