<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S15.F7.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 7</span>: </span><span id="S15.F7.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Example HumanEval single-line infilling generations from the any-length model fine-tuned with A2D2 at 128, 256, 512, and 1024 sampling steps. The model is given the function prefix and suffix and infills the line marked <span id="S15.F7.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter"># &lt;-- infilled</span>. All four reconstruct the ground-truth line exactly.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
